  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "22. Other Rules And Abilities",
    "ruleNumber": "22.05",
    "summary": "Improve a ranged attack's BS by 1 when it targets a visible unit with at least one model at ground level and either:\n\n- the attacker is on a terrain feature section 3\" or more high\n- the attacker is **TOWERING** and the target is within 12\"\n\nExamples: unit A, entirely on terrain at least 3\" high, gets the bonus against a target with models at ground level; model B is at ground level but **TOWERING**, and its target is within 12\" with models at ground level, so it gets the bonus too.",
